  "body": "Unpublished source staging for the v3 historical AINA audit.\n\n100x100.zip is an existing author-held archive containing the exact 250 GitHub Actions artifacts of a-a-k/otel-demo-resilience run19590510289, head a8bc5a29a15443ad3a4ef6b88ac710afb97c70c0. Every inner ZIP was verified by byte count and SHA-256 against the surviving original artifact API metadata, although those original artifacts are now expired. Source-transfer manifest records every match and the exact outer checksum.\n\nThis draft is an authenticated input source for remote GitHub Actions analysis. It is not a published release or a new result. Full graphs/live records remain unprocessed locally; compact provenance and audit results are tracked separately in Git. Do not publish this draft automatically.\n",
